     <target value="2800"></target>
     <actual value="5438">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">End target exceeded by nearly double. This is lower than the previous period because of the following. Periodically (once a year)CEN (European Standardization Council) abrogates some standards, which are obsolete or should be changed, etc. Consequently, thisinformation and the list of abrogated standards is submitted to all European National Standardization bodies (in our case NISM),who exclude abrogated by CEN standards from their list. In conclusion  - the difference between 5860 and 5438 are abrogatedstandards.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
